{"url": "https://x.com/RAMcgi/status/2101536941321728339", "id": "2101536941321728339", "text": "I'm sharing Dexter \u2014 a homelab boss for Grok Bot. Maps your hardware stack (firewall/router, hypervisor, OOB, webserver, mediaserver), recommends how each bot should reach the gear or applications and where to run Grok Bot, then spins focused specialist bots after you confirm. I've tested it on Proxmox and UniFi \u2014 you can ask the boss to build a new website on a new VM, and it will build a VM, build the website, set up ports and firewall rules, full stack to live and testing. It also manages your media library and game servers, and can notify you of Wi\u2011Fi configuration issues or security concerns.\nTemplate: https://x.ai/bot/wsyMavZM6PYzV3lgklehG", "raw_text": {"text": "I'm sharing Dexter \u2014 a homelab boss for Grok Bot. Maps your hardware stack (firewall/router, hypervisor, OOB, webserver, mediaserver), recommends how each bot should reach the gear or applications and where to run Grok Bot, then spins focused specialist bots after you confirm. I've tested it on Proxmox and UniFi \u2014 you can ask the boss to build a new website on a new VM, and it will build a VM, build the website, set up ports and firewall rules, full stack to live and testing. It also manages your media library and game servers, and can notify you of Wi\u2011Fi configuration issues or security concerns.\nTemplate: https://t.co/HI4mjQduv4", "display_text_range": [0, 638], "facets": [{"type": "url", "indices": [615, 638], "original": "https://t.co/HI4mjQduv4", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/wsyMavZM6PYzV3lgklehG", "display": "x.ai/bot/wsyMavZM6P\u2026"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "RAMcgi", "url": "https://x.com/RAMcgi", "id": "111239310", "followers": 179, "following": 445, "likes": 13232, "media_count": 56, "name": "Alex Mullins", "description": "Server Administrator, Programmer, Photographer, A/V Technician Former: inland recovery TowBoat operator, Marine Electrician, web-devel